    "notes": [
      "Nine freshly generated portrait cells are reference-inspired approximations, not confirmed character identities.",
      "Source steampunk wall is approximated by a flat brown root because a matching clean backdrop is unavailable.",
      "Original rarity badges, ability sub-icons and global icon navigation are omitted; first six level labels are retained. Third-row labels are behind the source bottom tabs and omitted.",
      "Pilot and Pappo are two separate native text captions. Pappo destination content is unobserved; no Pappo input route is added.",
      "v007 native tab/filter/advance captions are children of their corresponding button, preserving two-part copy/reuse and the correct button input/state ownership.",
      "v007 Pilot list uses a transparent role-frame ListViewport ABS(0,280,420,520), overflow=scroll-y. Pilot1..9 are its children with original ABS rectangles unchanged; portrait/level descendants remain under their cards. The viewport clips at y800 so third-row content does not cross CollectionTabs/footer, and normal native scrolling can expose it. Actual scrolling is not verified by this recipe review."
    ]
  },
